    "https://fa-exci-saasfaprod1.fa.ocs.oraclecloud.com/hcmUI/CandidateExperience/en/sites/CX_2/job/1033": {
      "title": "Special Events & Event Services Administrative Coordinator",
      "description": "The Department of Special Events & Event Services in College Relations at Davidson College seeks a highly professional, proactive, and exceptionally detail-oriented Administrative Coordinator. This role reports to the Senior Director of Special Events & Event Services to manage high level departmental operations. Additionally, it maintains an operational, dotted-line reporting relationship with the Director of Special Events to ensure seamless support of event planning and preparation processes.\n\nThis role requires a person with the judgment to support and interact with senior leadership and the organizational acumen to manage complex departmental operations. They will ensure that every engagement, from presidential events to daily operations, upholds the college’s standard of excellence and commitment to hospitality.",
      "department": null
    },
