      "title": "Administrative Assistant II Event Services - PT",
      "description": "The Administrative Assistant for Event Services plays a foundational, operationally vital role within the Office of Special Events & Event Services (SEES). Reporting to the Senior Director of Special Events & Event Services, this 20-hour per week role manages the essential daily machinery of the office in partnership with the Administrative Coordinator.\n\nAs a core member of the administrative team, the Administrative Assistant is instrumental in maintaining the team's high standard of excellence. This role demands exceptional attention to detail in managing the daily operations of the office, including billing, expense processing, data management, inventory, and other administrative tasks that must be executed with precision. The ideal candidate will embrace the primarily behind-the-scenes support nature of this role while remaining a welcoming, professional representative of the team during all internal and external guest-facing interactions.",
      "department": null
    },
