      "description": "A Much Ado Catering Associate supports catering operations by assisting with pre-event preparation, event setup, service, and cleanup, and post-event pantry organization. This role requires excellent customer service skills, attention to detail, and the ability to work in a fast-paced environment. The catering associate reports directly to the catering manager.\n\nMuch Ado Catering is the Catering Department under Davidson Dining Services. This is a 12-month on-call position receiving a maximum of 500 hours per year. During the academic year, our dining locations operate seven days a week serving three meals a day for the students, guests, staff, and faculty of Davidson College. This position is a part of the Davidson Dining Services Department and may require cross departmental assistance in another dining location outside of catering.",
