      "title": "Associate Director of Housing Operations & Facilities",
      "description": "The Associate Director of Housing Operations and Facilities at Davidson College is a full-time, twelve-month, salaried position reporting to the Assistant Dean of Students and Director of Residence Life. The Associate Director plays a critical leadership role in advancing Davidson’s residential experience by ensuring efficient, student-centered housing operations, facilities coordination, access management, occupancy processes, and service delivery for the College’s residential population. The position serves as a primary liaison between Residence Life, Facilities, Technology & Innovation, Campus Police, CatCard Services, Student Accounts, and other campus partners.",
