      "title": "Coordinator of Student Activities for Fraternity & Sorority Life",
      "description": "The Coordinator helps to organize fraternity and sorority life at Davidson College. As a member of the Student Activities staff and of the Division of Student Life, the Coordinator will join a competent, committed team who cares deeply about students and each other. The Coordinator partners with the Student Activities team to foster an inclusive, celebratory, and student-learning centered environment. The Coordinator serves as a leader in organizational leadership, development, risk management, and advising. The Coordinator of Student Activities is a 12-month, non-exempt, term-limited position and will be required to work in person, on campus, and attend some regular night and weekend events and meetings. Though the position is term-limited, there will be an opportunity to extend the appointment following review.",
      "department": null
