      "title": "Assistant Professor of Sociology",
      "description": "The Sociology department at Davidson College invites applications for a tenure-track Assistant Professor starting July 1, 2027. We are looking for someone with expertise in Urban Sociology, broadly defined. Candidates should be prepared to teach at least two of our required courses in theory, methods, or statistics. We are especially interested in new Sociology courses that will broaden our curriculum with potential contributions to Davidson College's interdisciplinary programs (including Africana Studies, Data Science, Digital Studies, East Asian Studies, Environmental Studies, Gender and Sexuality Studies, Latin American Studies, Public Health, and South Asian Studies). New professors teach four courses in their first year and then five courses each year thereafter.",
